---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Ruler } from "lucide-react";
---

<Layout title="Guía de Tallas | Kuro Custom">
  <div class="bg-[#0e0e0e] min-h-screen py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
      <div class="bg-[#161616] rounded-sm p-10 md:p-16 border border-[#2d2d2d] text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#1f1f1f] text-[#f0f0f0] rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-8 border border-[#2d2d2d]">
          <Ruler size={24} strokeWidth={1.5} />
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#f0f0f0] mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest border-b border-[#2d2d2d] pb-6 inline-block">Dimensiones</h1>
        <p class="text-[#888888] mb-12 mt-6 max-w-xl mx-auto font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Las medidas detalladas corresponden al ancho del pecho (axila a axila) y el largo total (hombro al borde inferior).
        </p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto border border-[#2d2d2d] rounded-sm">
          <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-[#1f1f1f] text-[#f0f0f0] text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">
                <th class="p-5 font-bold border-b border-[#2d2d2d]">Talla</th>
                <th class="p-5 font-bold border-b border-[#2d2d2d]">Ancho (Pecho)</th>
                <th class="p-5 font-bold border-b border-[#2d2d2d]">Largo</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="text-[#888888] font-light text-sm">
              <tr class="border-b border-[#2d2d2d] hover:bg-[#1f1f1f] transition-colors">
                <td class="p-5 font-medium text-[#f0f0f0]">S</td>
                <td class="p-5">46 cm</td>
                <td class="p-5">71 cm</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-[#2d2d2d] hover:bg-[#1f1f1f] transition-colors">
                <td class="p-5 font-medium text-[#f0f0f0]">M</td>
                <td class="p-5">51 cm</td>
                <td class="p-5">74 cm</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-[#2d2d2d] hover:bg-[#1f1f1f] transition-colors">
                <td class="p-5 font-medium text-[#f0f0f0]">L</td>
                <td class="p-5">56 cm</td>
                <td class="p-5">76 cm</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#1f1f1f] transition-colors">
                <td class="p-5 font-medium text-[#f0f0f0]">XL</td>
                <td class="p-5">61 cm</td>
                <td class="p-5">79 cm</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-[#1f1f1f] rounded-sm text-left border border-[#2d2d2d]">
          <p class="text-xs text-[#888888] font-light leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wide">
            <strong class="text-[#f0f0f0]">Referencia:</strong> Mide una prenda de uso frecuente sobre una superficie plana y compara. Margen de tolerancia de confección: +/- 2 cm.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
